WEBVTT

01:47.180 --> 01:50.130
are going to stay at my place while they fix their house.

01:58.030 --> 02:00.850
We'll be in your care for a little while.

02:00.850 --> 02:02.140
Sorry for the trouble.

02:02.400 --> 02:04.230
When we're in trouble, we all need help.

02:04.230 --> 02:06.390
We're neighbors, anyway.

02:06.390 --> 02:09.600
I don't think rafts can have neighbors.

02:09.600 --> 02:12.400
It must have been very tough.

02:12.400 --> 02:14.650
Well, we can't help it.

02:15.730 --> 02:18.130
I'm gonna be staying over at Kaname-chan's place, huh?

02:18.130 --> 02:20.120
There's no other choice.

02:20.470 --> 02:23.260
Now, I'll be leaving to fix the raft.

02:24.350 --> 02:27.160
Hey, Kaname-chan, can I take a shower?

02:27.160 --> 02:29.240
Yeah, sure.

02:30.620 --> 02:33.200
She's such an energetic, good girl.

02:33.200 --> 02:35.150
Take care of her.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.790
"Take care?"

02:36.790 --> 02:38.900
I think you're mixing things up.

02:41.010 --> 02:42.790
Ok, ok, ok, ok, ok.

02:42.790 --> 02:44.260
Hey, the bathroom isn't over there...

02:46.310 --> 02:48.320
You want a shower, too?

02:49.400 --> 02:51.990
Kaname-chan, what's this dog's name?

02:53.150 --> 02:53.950
Lala!

02:53.950 --> 02:54.800
It's Lala!

02:55.550 --> 02:57.090
So it's a girl.

02:57.090 --> 02:58.490
Such a cute name.

03:00.240 --> 03:02.040
It doesn't matter.

03:02.040 --> 03:03.950
Just put a towel on.

03:07.310 --> 03:09.120
Hey, hey, Kaname-chan.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.830
Lend me some clothes as well.

03:11.910 --> 03:17.570
Well, if you wear mine, it's a little, you know. If something were to happen...

03:18.620 --> 03:19.800
It's so big!

03:18.620 --> 03:19.800
H-Hey!

03:20.810 --> 03:22.510
Where are you...

03:22.910 --> 03:24.410
2nd floor?

03:24.410 --> 03:25.050
Could it be?

03:25.530 --> 03:26.850
H-Hey!

03:26.850 --> 03:27.560
Amuro!

03:33.300 --> 03:37.270
Hey, don't go into my room without my permission.

03:42.680 --> 03:45.320
How do I look?

03:45.850 --> 03:49.610
To have a female classmate staying at my place...

03:49.610 --> 03:51.800
This situation is...

03:54.370 --> 03:56.170
I wonder if there's any food.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.670
Hey!

03:57.670 --> 03:59.320
Don't touch my stuff!

03:59.320 --> 04:00.270
H-Hey!

04:00.270 --> 04:01.500
Stop it!

04:02.510 --> 04:03.970
Kouda Miku?

04:04.390 --> 04:05.720
School Nandaro.

04:05.720 --> 04:07.930
This is an invasion of privacy!

04:08.700 --> 04:10.980
I wonder if there's a video in there.

04:13.070 --> 04:15.020
N-Not that!

04:36.670 --> 04:37.880
So close...

04:47.360 --> 04:48.320
A-Amuro...

04:50.470 --> 04:53.200
Kaname-chan...

05:00.090 --> 05:02.910
There's something on your head.

05:11.180 --> 05:12.740
This is...

05:12.740 --> 05:15.910
Probably Shizuoka-san's underwear!

05:20.070 --> 05:21.720
Could this be...

05:22.210 --> 05:26.420
Could it be that she was here?!

05:27.370 --> 05:29.510
A girl's panties?

05:29.960 --> 05:31.890
N-No, this is...

05:31.890 --> 05:32.430
Um, you know...

05:32.850 --> 05:33.780
That's right!

05:33.780 --> 05:36.980
My mom's underwear got here by mistake.

05:37.560 --> 05:39.650
Did you call for me?

05:40.820 --> 05:43.110
You guys were in the middle of it.

05:43.110 --> 05:44.360
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

05:48.370 --> 05:50.610
She totally misunderstood.

05:50.610 --> 05:53.780
Do you like panties, Kaname-chan?

05:54.250 --> 05:56.000
N-No, that's not it!

05:56.000 --> 05:56.500
This is...

05:56.750 --> 06:01.330
Then do you want mine, too?

06:03.690 --> 06:04.840
No, thanks.

06:08.020 --> 06:09.490
Listen up!

06:09.490 --> 06:12.600
We are men and women at the age of being allowed to marry.

06:12.950 --> 06:14.740
You said men and women...

06:15.330 --> 06:16.890
What's so funny?!

06:18.250 --> 06:21.300
People are going to be suspicious of us for living together in the first place,

06:21.300 --> 06:23.060
so it'd be trouble if any weird rumors get out.

06:24.330 --> 06:25.570
Weird rumors?

06:26.500 --> 06:29.730
Anyway, you are not allowed to enter without permission.

06:30.260 --> 06:31.260
Got it?

06:31.260 --> 06:32.070
Yes!

06:41.020 --> 06:44.040
Hiro-chan, why are you still eating?

06:55.060 --> 06:55.930
Damn!

06:55.930 --> 06:56.600
I can't sleep!

07:02.120 --> 07:03.180
A-Amuro...

07:05.060 --> 07:07.690
Kaname-chan...

07:15.250 --> 07:17.130
1 sheep.

07:17.130 --> 07:19.010
2 sheep.

07:19.010 --> 07:20.690
3 sheep.

07:20.690 --> 07:22.540
4 sheep.

07:22.540 --> 07:24.700
5 sheep.

07:27.310 --> 07:30.010
1136 Amuros.

07:30.010 --> 07:32.220
1137 Amuros.

07:32.220 --> 07:34.810
1138 Amuros.

07:34.810 --> 07:35.990
Amuros....

07:37.010 --> 07:38.470
Kaname-chan.

07:38.470 --> 07:41.600
Swim with me, Kaname-chan.

07:47.440 --> 07:48.610
Kaname-chan.

07:49.960 --> 07:52.700
1139 Amuros.

07:53.220 --> 07:54.990
Kaname-chan.

08:01.460 --> 08:03.190
You're finally up!

08:03.190 --> 08:04.670
Let's go for a morning walk!

08:05.170 --> 08:06.970
What are you doing?!

08:06.970 --> 08:09.220
The door says not to enter!

08:09.220 --> 08:11.570
That's why I came in from there.

08:15.560 --> 08:18.780
I'll tag along. I need to find wood to rebuild the raft.

08:18.780 --> 08:21.520
Then, it's decided!

08:21.520 --> 08:23.140
This father and daughter...

08:36.090 --> 08:37.910
It's only 6 o'clock.

08:37.910 --> 08:39.370
What am I doing here?

08:39.620 --> 08:44.620
Ken, ken, pa is a game played by kids in Japan

08:39.620 --> 08:41.120
Ken, ken, pa.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.880
It's so big!

08:45.870 --> 08:46.830
I found a shelf!

08:47.180 --> 08:48.190
Here we go!

08:48.620 --> 08:50.350
We can put books on there.

08:51.250 --> 08:52.640
I see.

08:52.640 --> 08:56.040
They said that the raft gets destroyed by storms sometimes,

08:56.040 --> 08:58.920
so this is how they've been collecting stuff.

09:03.740 --> 09:05.520
So her bathing suit was safe.

09:07.310 --> 09:09.330
Damn, can't get this one off.

09:09.330 --> 09:10.570
You can't take that!

09:12.370 --> 09:14.110
Geez, what is he thinking?

09:14.110 --> 09:17.820
Let's go to the trees over there together!

09:18.240 --> 09:19.490
Together?

09:20.830 --> 09:22.740
Take care of her!

09:22.740 --> 09:24.540
Hey, it's not like that!

09:43.520 --> 09:47.560
I know it's wrong, but somehow I keep finding myself here.

09:49.070 --> 09:53.570
I don't like people looking at me, but from here,

09:53.930 --> 09:55.270
I can look as much as I want!

09:57.020 --> 09:59.570
Is someone in there?!

10:03.440 --> 10:05.480
Amuro, you can't go in there.

10:05.480 --> 10:07.500
But the door was open.

10:07.830 --> 10:10.190
Ninagawa-san and Okiura-kun?

10:10.190 --> 10:12.520
Let's just go, or we'll get cursed.

10:12.520 --> 10:15.480
What are those two doing here so early in the morning?

10:15.480 --> 10:17.450
H-Hey, you idiot, don't touch it!

10:19.640 --> 10:20.520
Why?

10:20.520 --> 10:22.100
It looks soft and tasty.

10:22.100 --> 10:24.100
It's not food!

10:24.470 --> 10:25.840
"Don't touch it."

10:26.550 --> 10:29.210
It's not food, and it's soft.

10:29.210 --> 10:30.100
Could it be?

10:31.510 --> 10:33.520
But when you touch it, it's kinda hard.

10:33.880 --> 10:35.530
S-Stop!

10:35.530 --> 10:39.000
The soft thing gets a little harder when you touch it?

10:39.740 --> 10:41.040
What is it like?

10:41.040 --> 10:42.030
I want to see!

10:42.430 --> 10:44.720
We'll be in trouble if someone sees.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.830
Come on, now.

10:48.610 --> 10:51.790
I can't take it anymore!

10:51.790 --> 10:54.540
Can't you at least do it quieter?

10:56.800 --> 10:58.390
You're stuffing too much in there!

10:58.390 --> 10:59.670
But it's so good.

11:03.350 --> 11:05.090
I-I'm sorry!

11:05.090 --> 11:08.230
Um, I, wasn't planning on peeping.

11:08.580 --> 11:10.170
Shizuoka-san.

11:11.630 --> 11:13.940
We're not like that!

11:14.360 --> 11:16.070
I'm sorry!

11:19.960 --> 11:23.700
But, why was Shizuoka-san here?

11:28.240 --> 11:30.630
Looks like she misunderstood something.

11:30.630 --> 11:32.290
What, what? Misunderstanding?

11:34.550 --> 11:39.530
You know, even after your house was destroyed and your furniture was lost,

11:39.530 --> 11:41.010
how can you be so carefree?

11:41.510 --> 11:43.310
Because these things happen.

11:43.310 --> 11:45.550
We didn't have anything important in that house anyway.

11:47.190 --> 11:51.020
The most important thing to me...

11:55.530 --> 11:57.070
is in the ocean.

12:07.780 --> 12:10.830
You work at your own pace, and you have no common sense.

12:12.540 --> 12:15.040
What kind of lifestyle have you had until now?

12:15.390 --> 12:19.310
I don't mind you living at my place, but I've had enough of being dragged around by you.

12:27.890 --> 12:28.810
Amuro.

12:43.210 --> 12:45.320
I might have said too much.

12:46.390 --> 12:48.450
No, I definitely said too much.

12:53.750 --> 12:54.500
Yo.

12:55.260 --> 12:57.920
Isn't that the shrine's?

12:59.000 --> 13:04.740
Even though the city has been urbanized, Ono Island hasn't changed at all.

13:06.740 --> 13:09.290
I'm originally from here.

13:09.290 --> 13:11.750
I'm actually an Umisho graduate.

13:13.440 --> 13:18.460
I had a kid with a girl I met in Okinawa on a trip by myself.

13:18.460 --> 13:19.430
Amuro, that is.

13:21.020 --> 13:23.480
Then, I decided to live over there.

13:26.730 --> 13:28.060
I see.

13:28.570 --> 13:30.030
Anyway, where's Amuro?

13:30.030 --> 13:31.650
Actually...

13:31.650 --> 13:33.500
Did you two fight?

13:35.030 --> 13:37.950
That means you two are close enough to fight!

13:37.950 --> 13:39.540
There you go, stirring things up again!

13:39.900 --> 13:44.000
Even though she might look energetic, Amuro has a lot of problems.

13:46.290 --> 13:52.990
Last year, Amuro's grandma didn't return from a swim in the ocean.

13:54.250 --> 13:55.840
That means...

13:56.910 --> 13:59.500
She probably died.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.520
Amuro loved her grandma.

14:06.610 --> 14:08.820
She got those X's on her head from her grandma.

14:17.050 --> 14:19.690
The most important thing to me...

14:19.690 --> 14:21.460
is in the ocean.

14:24.820 --> 14:26.840
I'm going to look for Amuro!

14:37.950 --> 14:39.050
Amuro!

14:51.550 --> 14:52.660
Where's Amuro?!

14:52.660 --> 14:54.070
Weren't you with her?

14:54.890 --> 14:56.830
Hey, what about lunch?

14:59.330 --> 15:02.040
Amuro-senpai!

15:02.430 --> 15:03.980
Makio-chan.

15:05.520 --> 15:06.920
Kaname-senpai.

15:07.260 --> 15:08.710
Good morning.

15:10.120 --> 15:10.990
She here?

15:10.990 --> 15:11.850
No.

15:11.850 --> 15:13.250
She's hasn't come back.

15:14.980 --> 15:16.910
Is there another place she might have gone?

15:17.930 --> 15:19.980
What's wrong with Amuro-senpai?

15:20.800 --> 15:22.230
She's gone.

15:24.000 --> 15:27.770
She could be at the cave.

15:27.770 --> 15:29.570
The cave at Ono Island?

15:29.570 --> 15:30.970
Yeah.

15:30.970 --> 15:35.580
That place looks like the rocks that her grandma swam from at Okinawa.

15:36.190 --> 15:39.770
Whenever something happened to Amuro, she would always go to her grandma's rock.

15:42.300 --> 15:44.550
Ok, Makio-chan, help me look for her!

15:44.550 --> 15:45.540
Understood.

16:02.490 --> 16:03.810
Hello.

16:04.060 --> 16:07.310
I don't know what's going on, but Amuro-senpai is missing!

16:17.280 --> 16:19.700
Hey, this is Japanese restaurant, Ikariya!

16:20.050 --> 16:21.220
Awesome!

16:21.220 --> 16:22.900
He's beaten 42 guys already!

16:46.460 --> 16:48.510
Amuro!

16:49.040 --> 16:50.480
Hey!

16:50.480 --> 16:51.400
Amuro!

17:22.980 --> 17:24.550
Where are you?!

17:56.880 --> 17:58.290
Ono-chan?!

18:00.760 --> 18:03.890
Don't scare me like that.

18:06.100 --> 18:08.570
It's Sunday.

18:08.570 --> 18:09.880
You've gotta be kidding me.

18:09.880 --> 18:13.810
I couldn't get a hold of everyone, because they were busy.

18:13.810 --> 18:19.630
But I'm glad that Orizuka-senpai and Ikamasa-senpai were available.

18:20.570 --> 18:22.660
I wasn't actually free, you know!

18:23.010 --> 18:24.800
Well, it's all good.

18:24.800 --> 18:27.070
Ono Island's cave exploration.

18:27.070 --> 18:30.040
The cave is so close that it's like a booger on the side of my nose.

18:30.040 --> 18:31.670
I don't come here often anyway.

18:33.580 --> 18:35.880
I used to play here all the time!

18:35.880 --> 18:37.690
There!

18:37.690 --> 18:38.920
That's dangerous!

18:42.140 --> 18:43.310
He's a moron.

18:45.690 --> 18:47.390
Momoko, why don't you fly, too?

18:47.390 --> 18:49.180
I'll definitely catch you.

18:50.080 --> 18:51.480
Ikamasa.

18:52.520 --> 18:54.500
Now come.

18:54.500 --> 18:55.980
On second thought, no!

18:56.400 --> 18:57.980
Amuro!

19:12.260 --> 19:13.860
Kaname-chan.

19:30.230 --> 19:31.990
Amuro!

19:33.270 --> 19:34.660
Don't!

19:42.320 --> 19:45.370
That's why I told you not to come.

19:45.370 --> 19:46.830
Are you okay, Kaname-chan?

19:48.570 --> 19:49.780
Oh, it doesn't hurt.

19:50.510 --> 19:54.800
My stomach ache is gone, because you scared me.

19:54.800 --> 19:55.930
Stomach?

19:55.930 --> 19:57.720
Then you were crying, because...

19:57.720 --> 20:00.350
Yeah, my stomach suddenly started hurting.

20:00.350 --> 20:01.840
I wonder why.

20:02.100 --> 20:04.780
Because those offerings you ate were spoiled.

20:05.900 --> 20:07.050
I see.

20:07.650 --> 20:08.930
But look.

20:09.280 --> 20:11.940
There's a lot of seaweed here.

20:11.940 --> 20:16.280
I was thinking of taking this back as a present since we'll be staying at your place.

20:16.280 --> 20:19.940
Geez, I thought you were running away.

20:20.330 --> 20:21.760
But, I'm sorry.

20:21.760 --> 20:25.540
I didn't know that your grandma died in the ocean.

20:25.540 --> 20:29.400
You're going through a lot, and I said those awful things to you.

20:29.400 --> 20:31.040
She's not dead.

20:32.580 --> 20:35.460
Grandma can stay in the ocean forever.

20:35.810 --> 20:38.710
But your dad said that those X's are mementos of your grandma.

20:38.710 --> 20:40.430
It's not a memento.

20:41.860 --> 20:44.500
I'll give these to you, Amuro.

20:44.500 --> 20:46.440
You'll be cursed if you lose them.

20:48.800 --> 20:49.890
That's why.

20:51.690 --> 20:54.140
I plan on returning the X's.

20:54.790 --> 20:55.900
Amuro.

20:55.900 --> 20:57.340
There they are.

20:57.340 --> 20:59.320
Oh, you guys!

20:59.600 --> 21:01.870
They helped us with the search.

21:01.870 --> 21:04.070
They happened to have some free time.

21:04.070 --> 21:07.900
What are you two flirting around for after you ruined my day off?

21:07.900 --> 21:10.700
I'm gonna ruin it, too.

21:10.990 --> 21:12.910
Captain, you can't come here!

21:12.910 --> 21:15.500
I'm not listening.

21:15.500 --> 21:17.410
Hot!

21:17.410 --> 21:18.920
I told you so.

21:29.930 --> 21:32.450
I've never seen this kind of fish.

21:32.450 --> 21:36.090
Seaweed is good for your hair.

21:36.090 --> 21:38.670
This fish is pretty good, you know.

21:52.950 --> 21:55.730
A superb view!

21:58.960 --> 22:02.410
She sure does regain her energy when she sees the ocean.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.910
Isn't she a good girl?

22:03.910 --> 22:04.960
Y-Yes.

22:05.320 --> 22:07.770
It's because she's my daughter.

22:08.510 --> 22:10.970
Please be good friends with her.

22:16.820 --> 22:18.670
Hey, what are you doing?!

22:18.670 --> 22:19.480
Are you...

22:20.980 --> 22:23.980
I feel like swimming after watching the ocean.

22:26.110 --> 22:27.610
Hey wait!

22:27.610 --> 22:28.990
It'll be dangerous to jump!

22:30.220 --> 22:31.750
Don't worry!

22:38.530 --> 22:41.040
Amuro has been at Umisho for a month.

22:41.460 --> 22:43.590
I don't quite get her yet, but...

22:46.400 --> 22:51.430
I feel like I kind of understand why Amuro likes the ocean.

22:57.700 --> 23:00.310
Geez, what is she thinking?

23:00.910 --> 23:03.130
Seaweed is magnificent.

23:03.130 --> 23:05.110
My ocean romance...

23:06.910 --> 23:09.760
She sure is mysterious.

24:46.320 --> 24:48.170
We have trouble!

24:48.170 --> 24:50.920
There's gonna be a transfer student joining the Umisho swimming team!

24:51.210 --> 24:52.340
Please listen carefully.

24:52.690 --> 24:54.050
Fashion magazine,

24:54.050 --> 24:55.630
two consecutive championships,

24:55.630 --> 24:57.600
all-star middle-schooler,

24:57.600 --> 25:02.110
a-and the locker room is totally see through!

25:02.110 --> 25:04.850
Captain, no, you can't do that!

25:05.850 --> 25:09.270
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho:

25:09.270 --> 25:09.960
No!

25:09.960 --> 25:13.220
Ono-chan's true identity is...
